@testray.main.component.name = "Patcher Builder"
Feature: Patcher Builder and 73 dxp-1 builds
  	Testing creation of 73 dxp-1 builds on Patcher Builder.
  
  Setup:
  	* I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage

  Scenario: Run fix pack builder hotfix 7x job
    @priority = "5"
    As a TSE, I should be able to run the fixpack-builder-hotfix-7x, test-fixpack-builder-install and test-fixpack-builder-revert jobs

    Given I start the fixpack-builder-hotfix-7x job with the following parameters
      | fix.pack.baseCommittish          | fix-pack-dxp-1-7310                                                                                                                                                                        |
      | fix.pack.built.for               | LRGROW                                                                                                                                                                                     |
      | fix.pack.customer.ticket         | 12345                                                                                                                                                                                      |
      | fix.pack.fixed.issues            | LPS-122256,LPS-122948,LPS-124104,LPS-125487,LPS-127040,LPS-127840,LPS-129422,LPS-129759,LPS-131497,LPS-131644,LPS-132373,LPS-132588,LPS-134144,LPS-134572,LPS-138998,LPS-139221,LPS-142141 |
      | fix.pack.hotfixed.issues         | LPS-122256,LPS-122948,LPS-124104,LPS-125487,LPS-127040,LPS-127840,LPS-129422,LPS-129759,LPS-131497,LPS-131644,LPS-132373,LPS-132588,LPS-134144,LPS-134572,LPS-138998,LPS-139221,LPS-142141 |
      | fix.pack.id                      | 1739                                                                                                                                                                                       |
      | git.revision                     | cc90517c4af6fe4a652a76cbb3de731d2f380925                                                                                                                                                   |
      | patcher.build.id                 | 208038451                                                                                                                                                                                  |
      | patcher.combined.branch          | true                                                                                                                                                                                       |
      | patcher.fix.delivery.method      | Fix Pack 3.0                                                                                                                                                                               |
      | patcher.request.key              | 90a9feb32c47eb72e0f4270aac87d93556d88432                                                                                                                                                   |
      | patcher.security.patch           | false                                                                                                                                                                                      |
      | patcher.user.id                  | 10196                                                                                                                                                                                      |
    And I wait for "5" seconds
    And I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage
    And I get the current build number for the job titled "fixpack-builder-hotfix-7x(2x-uat)"
    And I check the job with the name "fixpack-builder-hotfix-7x(2x-uat)" and build number "${staticJobBuildNumber}" for completion
    And I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage
    When the job with the name "fixpack-builder-hotfix-7x(2x-uat)" and build number "${staticJobBuildNumber}" should have been successful
    Then I test the patching tool install and revert features with the following parameters
      | bundle                   | /mnt/mfs-hdd1-172.16.168/ee/portal/7.3.10/liferay-dxp-tomcat-7.3.10-ga1-20200930160533946.7z                                                        |
      | fixPack                  | /mnt/mfs-hdd1-172.16.168/ee/fix-packs/7.3.10/dxp/liferay-fix-pack-dxp-1-7310.zip                                                                    |
      | hotfix                   | /mnt/mfs-hdd1-${jenkinsSlaveNumber}/live/opt/java/jenkins/userContent/liferay-fix-pack-builder/fix-packs/7.3.10/hotfix/liferay-hotfix-1739-7310.zip |
      | patchingTool             | /mnt/mfs-hdd1-172.16.168/ee/fix-packs/patching-tool/patching-tool-LATEST.zip                                                                        |
      | patchingToolMajorVersion | 3                                                                                                                                                   |
